-- Repo default; install-test.sh overwrites this file with the selected experiment.
-- exp: 0 = loader only, 1 = E0.1 hooks, 2 = E0.2 state, 3 = E0.3 trader. log: 0 silences TRF_L.
-- autosave: 1 = baseline save kit (exp_saves.script), 2 = the same without the mission 1 guard, 0 = off.
-- Optional keys: big=1 (E0.2 1000-entry table), del_on_jump=1 (E0.3 deletes live flights before a jump).
-- traffic: 1 = load the v0.1 traffic modules when exp is 0 (missing key = 1), 0 = loader and kits only.
-- Further v0.1 keys and their defaults: design/v01-spec.md 9 (TRF_OptDef in trf_state.script).
-- v0.2 keys (design/v02-spec.md 10.4), listed here with their defaults; a missing key reads the default of the
-- module's TRF_<M>_OptDef(). enabled 2 = restore changed station prices (and remove pirate bases) and stop;
-- pro_set is for the test clone. v1 keys (design/v1-spec.md 10.5), defaults of the v1 modules; tier_cap 4.
-- hail_xml: 1 = Data/Scripts/Trade/TRF_Hail.xml is installed (written by install.sh / install-test.sh when they
-- copied it). Tune hail_box (tune={hail_box=N}): 0 = hail answers as radio lines, 1 = ShowMsgBox chain (default),
-- 2 = the hail menu as the trade dialog TRF_Hail (needs hail_xml=1; otherwise the box chain runs).
-- Worldbuilding plumbing (design/wb-plumbing-spec.md): wb_box_after_fee (default 0) = 1 allows an offer box at the
-- trade dock after a station fee box (set once E0.6 passes); tune help_floor/help_decay (C1) and leg_cap (D1).
-- Survivors and beacons (design/survivors-spec.md 6): enable_survivors (default 1) = 0 turns trf_survive off; the
-- other sv_* keys and the tune keys (k_pod, sv_ttl, ...) read their module defaults when missing.
-- Faction service ladder (design/ladder-spec.md 6): lad_enabled (default 1) = 0 turns trf_ladder off; lad_rankline,
-- lad_permit, lad_settle, lad_handin, lad_gibdd, lad_reset_sync (step 1) and lad_escort, lad_depot, lad_warrant
-- (step 2, read nowhere yet) are the toggles; the tune keys (c_p, permit_legs, ...) read the module TuneDef.
function TRF_Config() return {exp=0, log=1, autosave=0, traffic=1,
	enabled=1, cycle=1, prosperity=1, tier_cap=4, cap_traders=5, cap_ships=20, spawn_scale=1.0, band_half=0,
	parked=1, esc_flight=1, seed=1, queue=1, raids=1, staged=1, contracts=1, esc_speed=0, meet=2, hail_start=2, board=1,
	shop_mode=1, short_price=1, restore=1, news_mode=1, heat_war=0, strict=1, pro_set={},
	track=1, conv=1, demand=1, heat_offer=1, carriers=1, salvage=1, salv_addmod=0, clan_ace=0, sweeps=1,
	sweep_ct=1, po=1, tt4=1, tt4_split=0, feq=1, forced_bust=1, dconv=1, dc_speed=1, bases=1, base_glow=0,
	wreck=0, lang="en", loc_mode=0, hail_xml=0, enable_survivors=1,
	lad_enabled=1, lad_rankline=1, lad_permit=1, lad_settle=1, lad_handin=1, lad_gibdd=1, lad_reset_sync=1,
	lad_escort=1, lad_depot=1, lad_warrant=1} end
